    "headline": "Linqto Continues to Pursue Litigation Against Forge and Schwab to Recover Millions of Dollars in Damages to More than 13,000 Linqto Customers",
    "summary": "SAN JOSE, Calif. & HOUSTON, August 10, 2026--Linqto, Inc. today announced that it continues to pursue its litigation against Forge Global, Inc. and its owner, The Charles Schwab Corporation, and would seek full monetary damages for harms caused to Linqto’s 13,000+ customers, as well as repayment of all legal fees connected to this case. Linqto also announced that it is pursuing alternative risk mitigation strategies to exit bankruptcy as quickly as possible should Forge Global continue to refuse",
